This product includes news article metadata (URL, headline, domain, date)
retrieved from the GDELT Project (https://www.gdeltproject.org/). Article
bodies are never downloaded or redistributed; headlines are used only as
private model input. "GDELT" and "The GDELT Project" are credited here and
on the published track-record site as required by the GDELT terms of use.

This product retrieves public question and market data from Manifold
Markets (https://manifold.markets/) via its public read API. Only question
titles, links, and this project's own probability forecasts are published;
no third-party content is redistributed.

This product uses the Anthropic API and/or Amazon Bedrock to call Claude
models. Model responses are used to compute probabilities; by default,
rationales are not published. See https://www.anthropic.com/legal/aup for
the Anthropic Usage Policy this project follows.

